        "event_id": "lite_evt_00093",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides a bounded next-step plan with follow-up owner, timing, channel, and emergency thresholds, and names what remains unresolved.",
        "quote": "5天后的儿科心内普通门诊可以先看，不必一定加原主任；普通门诊也能结合出院资料和动态心电图判断"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00064",
