    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00033",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks about current syncope recurrence, dizziness, chest symptoms, and palpitations, and confirms the child is currently asymptomatic.",
          "quote": "孩子目前不头晕、没有再晕"
